       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CGMULTI.
      *>====================================================================
      *> Program CGMULTI
      *> Generated by DSPF-RAD from CGMULTI
      *> Records: FIRSTSFL, FIRSTCTL, SECONDSFL, SECONDCTL
      *> Edit hint: code inside DSPF-RAD protected-region blocks
      *>            is preserved across regenerations; everything else is
      *>            rewritten when you regenerate from the RAD.
      *>====================================================================
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CGMULTI ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-CGMULTI-SI
                          ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                          ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                          RELATIVE KEY IS WS-SFL-RRN
                          FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  CGMULTI.
       01  CGMULTI-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF CGMULTI.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FLAGS.
           05  DONE-FLG          PIC X       VALUE "N".
           05  WS-FILE-STATUS    PIC X(2)    VALUE "00".
           05  WS-SFL-RRN        PIC 9(5)    COMP-4 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-SCREEN         PIC X(10)   VALUE "FIRSTCTL".
       01  INDICATORS.
           05  INDIC-TABLE OCCURS 99 PIC 1 INDICATOR 1.
               88  IND-OFF VALUE B"0".
               88  IND-ON  VALUE B"1".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM INITIALIZE-PROGRAM
           PERFORM PROCESS-SCREEN UNTIL DONE-FLG = "Y"
           PERFORM TERMINATE-PROGRAM
           GOBACK
           .

       INITIALIZE-PROGRAM.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=startup]
      *> Run-once initialisation: open files, fetch parameters, etc.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=startup]
           OPEN I-O CGMULTI
           .

       PROCESS-SCREEN.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=select-subfile-screen]
      *> Optionally set WS-SCREEN before the generated route selector.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=select-subfile-screen]
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=before-display]
      *> Populate fields for the next display operation.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=before-display]
      *> WS-SCREEN is managed by the RAD key-action flow.
           EVALUATE WS-SCREEN
              WHEN "FIRSTCTL"
                 PERFORM LOAD-SUBFILE
                 WRITE CGMULTI-REC FORMAT IS "FIRSTCTL"
                    INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
                 END-WRITE
                 READ CGMULTI FORMAT IS "FIRSTCTL"
                    INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
                 END-READ
              WHEN "SECONDCTL"
                 PERFORM LOAD-SUBFILE-02
                 WRITE CGMULTI-REC FORMAT IS "SECONDCTL"
                    INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
                 END-WRITE
                 READ CGMULTI FORMAT IS "SECONDCTL"
                    INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
                 END-READ
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE "FIRSTCTL" TO WS-SCREEN
                 PERFORM LOAD-SUBFILE
                 WRITE CGMULTI-REC FORMAT IS "FIRSTCTL"
                    INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
                 END-WRITE
                 READ CGMULTI FORMAT IS "FIRSTCTL"
                    INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
                 END-READ
           END-EVALUATE
           PERFORM HANDLE-INPUT
           .

       HANDLE-INPUT.
           EVALUATE TRUE
                 WHEN INDIC-TABLE (03) = B"1"
                    MOVE "Y" TO DONE-FLG
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=on-in03]
      *> Add custom handling for IN03 here.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=on-in03]
                 WHEN OTHER
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=on-enter]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=on-enter]
      *> Changed rows from FIRSTSFL:
      *> READ SUBFILE NEXT MODIFIED FORMAT IS "FIRSTSFL".
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=changed-firstsfl]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=changed-firstsfl]
      *> Changed rows from SECONDSFL:
      *> READ SUBFILE NEXT MODIFIED FORMAT IS "SECONDSFL".
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=changed-secondsfl]
                    CONTINUE
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=changed-secondsfl]
           END-EVALUATE
           .

       LOAD-SUBFILE.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=load-firstsfl]
      *> Clear the FIRSTSFL subfile, load it record-by-record,
      *> then turn on SFLDSP / SFLDSPCTL so the SFLCTL renders the loaded
      *> subfile on the next WRITE.
           MOVE B"1" TO INDIC-TABLE (30)
           WRITE CGMULTI-REC FORMAT IS "FIRSTCTL"
              INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
           END-WRITE
           MOVE B"0" TO INDIC-TABLE (30)

           MOVE 0 TO WS-SFL-RRN
      *> Iterate your data source and add records:
      *>   ADD 1 TO WS-SFL-RRN
      *>   ... populate FIRSTSFL fields ...
      *>   WRITE SUBFILE CGMULTI-REC FORMAT IS "FIRSTSFL"
      *>      INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
      *>   END-WRITE

           MOVE B"0" TO INDIC-TABLE (30)
           MOVE B"0" TO INDIC-TABLE (30)
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=load-firstsfl]
           .

       LOAD-SUBFILE-02.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=load-secondsfl]
      *> Clear the SECONDSFL subfile, load it record-by-record,
      *> then turn on SFLDSP / SFLDSPCTL so the SFLCTL renders the loaded
      *> subfile on the next WRITE.
           MOVE B"1" TO INDIC-TABLE (31)
           WRITE CGMULTI-REC FORMAT IS "SECONDCTL"
              INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
           END-WRITE
           MOVE B"0" TO INDIC-TABLE (31)

           MOVE 0 TO WS-SFL-RRN
      *> Iterate your data source and add records:
      *>   ADD 1 TO WS-SFL-RRN
      *>   ... populate SECONDSFL fields ...
      *>   WRITE SUBFILE CGMULTI-REC FORMAT IS "SECONDSFL"
      *>      INDICATORS ARE INDIC-TABLE
      *>   END-WRITE

           MOVE B"0" TO INDIC-TABLE (31)
           MOVE B"0" TO INDIC-TABLE (31)
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=load-secondsfl]
           .

       TERMINATE-PROGRAM.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION begin=shutdown]
      *> Cleanup: close files, log, etc.
      *> [DSPF-RAD-REGION end=shutdown]
           CLOSE CGMULTI
           .
